          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne hamanyeye bualu bubi buakenzeye, yeye neafile mukashi wa mbushi udi kayi ne tshilema bu mulambu wa bubi buakenzeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neatenteke tshianza tshiandi ha mutu ha mbushi wa mulambu wandi, neamushihe kudibo bashihela mulambu wa kuosha ha kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muakuidi neafue munu wandi mu mashi makuabo, nealabe ku nsengu ya ku tshioshelu tshia kahia, neahongolole mashi makuabo ku tshiaku tshia tshioshelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neumushe dianyi dionso bu muakenzeye ne mulambu wa kuvuisha nʼau ditalala, muakuidi neadioshe ha tshioshelu bu tshintu tshidi tshitue dihembu kudi Yehowa, muakuidi neafile mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi buandi, ne bubi buandi nebuikale bubuikidibue.",
          "type": "text",
