          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bialueye ne muana wa mukoko bu mulambu wa kubindila nʼau bubi, nealue biandi ne mukashi wa mukoko udi kauyi ne tshilema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye neatenteke tshianza tshiandi ha mutu ha mukoko wa mulambu wandi, neanshihe kudibo bashihela mulambu wa kuosha ha kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muakuidi neafue munu wandi mu mashi makuabo, neâlabe ku nsengu ya ku tshioshelu tshia kahia, neahongolole mashi onso makuabo ku tshitaku tshia tshioshelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neumushe dianyi dionso bu muakenzeye ne mulambu wa kuvuisha nʼau ditalala, muakuidi neadioshe ha tshioshelu bu muakenzeye ne milambu ya kuosha ha kahia, muakuidi neafile mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi buandi, ne bubi buandi nebuikale bubuikidibue.",
          "type": "text",
